no texture, no text. The subject floats in empty space with thin 1px linework, so the asset can be dropped onto any surface and stays legible at small sizes; it also leaves headline and CTA type as the loudest element of a hero section."}, {"id": "hero_electric_purple_palette", "label": "Electric Purple / Violet Brand Accent Palette", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/src/assets/hero.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Purple is the only saturated hue in the image and it is confined to a single edge against otherwise neutral white. Purple carries luxury/beauty connotations while the restraint (one accent, everything else neutral) keeps it premium rather than playful."}, {"id": "hero_premium_modern_mood", "label": "Premium, Calm, Tech-Modern Mood", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/src/assets/hero.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Soft rounded corners, generous whitespace, a single jewel-toned accent and no human subject produce a quiet, high-end, contemporary tone - positioning the booking product as a polished digital service rather than a discount scheduler."}, {"id": "hero_booking_visual_identity", "label": "Visual Identity of the Spa Booking Product", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/src/assets/hero.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The asset encodes the brand contract the rest of the UI inherits: neutral base, one electric-purple accent, rounded geometry, lots of air."}, {"id": "hero_unreferenced_asset_gap", "label": "Hero Asset Is Not Imported Anywhere", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "frontend/src/assets/hero.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A repo-w